@host = http://localhost:5702
@token = change-me

### Health (без авторизации)
GET {{host}}/health

### Send any text message
POST {{host}}/sendMessage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "message": "hello"
}

### Remove user by telegram username
DELETE {{host}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "username": "test"
}
